{"id":"36479","texts":[{"kind":"transcription","label":"תעתיק","editor":"umrethwala","citation":"Yusuf Umrethwala, unpublished editions (n.p., 2022).","html":"<section dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\"> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-60/2.json\"> <h3>60v</h3> <ol>\n<li>والاستقامة وا…</li>\n</ol> </div> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-61/2.json\"> <h3>61v</h3> <ol>\n<li>واولى المساعي الله[</li>\n<li>تصل الله بها حبل الـ[</li>\n</ol> </div> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-62/2.json\"> <h3>62v</h3> <ol>\n<li>الى فارط القضا فيه </li>\n<li>حقهم وجرت بينهم وبين</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p> </div> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-65/1.json\"> <h3>65v</h3> <ol>\n<li>مشاجرة ادت</li>\n<li>فتجمعوا لطلب</li>\n</ol> </div> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-66/1.json\"> <h3>66r</h3> <ol>\n<li>السعادة والفتح</li>\n<li>…ما احـ[</li>\n</ol> </div> <div data-canvas=\"https://princetongenizalab.github.io/iiif/bodleian/g/canvas/ms-heb-g-2-67/1.json\"> <h3>67r</h3> <ol>\n<li>الكافة ولله</li>\n<li>ولما كان بالامير ا[لاجل</li>\n</ol> </div> </section>"}]}